2026-07-27T12:18:32.4454889Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T12:18:32.4455258Z i /tmp/RtmpWrm2FZ/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:18:32.4455611Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:18:32.4456029Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:18:32.4456410Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:18:32.4456990Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:18:32.4458212Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:18:32.4458872Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
